Key Highlights
User traffic hits Kubernetes Service (NodePort)
Service routes requests to multiple replicated pods running Flask app
Pods are containerized using Docker for consistent environments
Health checks (/health) enable Kubernetes liveness/readiness probes
Monitoring stack (Prometheus + Grafana) collects metrics from pods
Horizontal Pod Autoscaler (HPA) automatically scales pods based on CPU usage
CI/CD pipeline (GitHub Actions) automates build & deployment
